IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-COMPOUND-MULTI-TIER.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ACTIVE-TIERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PASSED-TIERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 DEFECT-MASK         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 COMPOUND-SCORE      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-COMPOUND.
    IF DEFECT-MASK > 0 OR ACTIVE-TIERS != PASSED-TIERS
        GO TO COMPOUND-REPAIR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9990 TO COMPOUND-SCORE.
    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ACTIVE-TIERS.
    WEIGHT 30 PASSED-TIERS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 8.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

COMPOUND-REPAIR.
    MOVE 0 TO COMPOUND-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
